# example-db — read the database, never write it

This file is an example template for a bundle that `requires: [db]` and needs no ticket board.

Open the tunnel first: `{{.Tools.DB.Tunnel}}`. Then:

```bash
{{.Tools.DB.Cmd}} query{{if .Tools.DB.Schema}} --db {{.Tools.DB.Schema}}{{end}} "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM some_table"
```

Reads only. Writes, DDL and grants happen elsewhere, by a human.
